OL,3,GNEWSABusy Leicester roads closed due to
OL,4,Apolice incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo busy roads in Leicester have been
OL,7,Fclosed due to a police incident.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said on Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning Narborough Road was shut in
OL,11,Fboth directions between Braunstone Gate
OL,12,Fand Upperton Road.
OL,14,FIt added, in a social media post at
OL,15,F05:02 BST, Hinckley Road was also
OL,16,Fclosed.
OL,18,FThe force advised people to stay away
OL,19,Ffrom the area where possible.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
